# LOOP held in Session with white keys 1, 2, 2 and 3 (D16): the first press
# launches scene 1 alone (`scene 0`), the second makes the song [1] and adds
# scene 2 (`sgnew 0`, `songadd 1`), the others add. The song plays; at 6 s
# LOOP + key 5 launches scene 5 alone, which detaches the song and keeps its
# list; STOP then PLAY follows it again from entry 1.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--button 0.10:SEQ
--key 0.20:3:100:0.6
--key 0.30:0:100:0.05
--key 0.40:2:100:0.05
--key 0.50:2:100:0.05
--key 0.60:4:100:0.05
--key 6.00:3:100:0.3
--key 6.10:7:100:0.05
--button 8.00:PLAY/STOP
--button 8.50:PLAY/STOP
--button 12.00:PLAY/STOP
